		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					As a small team, we created most of the game's content ourselves, while also using paid and free third-party assets. The main character designs and the game's visual style are our own original work. AI tools were used to create some audio assets, which we plan to replace in future updates. Some ai draft visuals will be replaced with original artwork before the 1.0 release.<br />
				</i>
			</p>
